@startuml
title Smart Campus Study Room Booking - Domain Class Diagram

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class Student {
  - studentId: String
  - name: String
}

class Room {
  - roomId: String
  - name: String
  - blocked: Boolean

  + block()
  + unblock()
}

class Booking {
  - bookingId: String
  - startTime: DateTime
  - endTime: DateTime
  - status: BookingStatus

  + getDuration(): Duration
  + overlaps(other: Booking): Boolean
  + cancel()
}

class Administrator {
  - administratorId: String
  - name: String

  + blockRoom(room: Room)
  + unblockRoom(room: Room)
  + reviewUsage(startDate: Date, endDate: Date)
}

enum BookingStatus {
  ACTIVE
  CANCELLED
}

Student "1" -- "0..*" Booking : makes >
Room "1" -- "0..*" Booking : reserved for >

note right of Booking
R1:
startTime must be in the future.
Duration must be > 0 and <= 2 hours.

R2:
ACTIVE bookings for the same Room
must not overlap.

Touching bookings are allowed:
endTime = another startTime
is not an overlap.
end note

note right of Room
R3:
A blocked Room cannot accept
a new Booking.

Blocking does not automatically
cancel existing Bookings.
end note

note bottom of Booking
R4:
A successful booking produces
a confirmation.

US-04:
A successful cancellation also
produces a confirmation.
end note

note bottom of Administrator
US-05:
Administrator blocks or unblocks rooms.

US-06:
Administrator reviews usage based
on Booking information over
a selected period.
end note

@enduml